OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AKing Charles and Elton John in the
OL,4,Aaudience for Apple music workshop
OL,5,
OL,6,FKing Charles has visited a hi-tech
OL,7,Fmusic workshop for young people, in a
OL,8,Fcollaboration between his King's Trust
OL,9,Fcharity and technology firm Apple.
OL,11,FPop royalty, in the form of Sir Elton
OL,12,FJohn, was a special guest at the event,
OL,13,Fsitting beside the King, as they
OL,14,Flistened to a short performance from
OL,15,Fsinger-songwriter Skye Newman.
OL,17,FThe event was held at a music hall in
OL,18,FApple's headquarters building, in the
OL,19,Frestored Battersea Power Station in
OL,20,Fsouth west London.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
