OL,3,AKing Charles and Elton John in the
OL,4,Aaudience for Apple music workshop
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe project being backed by the King is
OL,7,Fintended to equip young people with
OL,8,Fpractical skills to work in the
OL,9,Fcreative industries.
